1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
[001] Actually, I'm heading there myself.
其實，我自己也正要去那裡。  [head: 去，前往…]

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:15,000
[002] All you'll have to do is write down your name.
您只需要寫下您的名字就可以了。  [write down: 寫下]

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,000
[003] Andy will cover my shift in the kitchen.
Andy 會代替我在廚房的輪班。  [shift: 輪班，交接班]

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:31,000
[004] Are you here to pick up your medication?
您是來領藥的嗎？  [medication: 藥物]

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,000
[005] Are you interested in one of our job openings?
您對我們的某個職缺有興趣嗎？  [job openings: 職缺，就業機會]

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:47,000
[006] Can you give me a demonstration of your products?
可以為我展示一下貴公司的產品嗎？  [demonstration: 示範，演示]

7
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:56,000
[007] Will I be compensated for all my moving costs?
我的搬家費用會全額補貼嗎？  [moving costs: 搬家費用]

8
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:04,000
[008] Congratulations on your promotion, Alex!
Alex，恭喜你獲得升遷！  [promotion: 升遷]

9
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:12,000
[009] Could you give me the last four digits of the credit card number?
可以給我信用卡號碼的最後四位數嗎？  [digits: 數字，位數]

10
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:19,000
[010] Did I cover everything you needed?
我有把您想知道的都說清楚了嗎？  [cover: 涵蓋，處理]

11
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:28,000
[011] Why don't you tell us what interests you the most about our position?
您可以告訴我們，我們這個職位中最吸引您的是哪一點嗎？  [interest: 引起關注]

12
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:35,000
[012] Do you know anyone fluent in Mandarin?
您知道有誰中文講得很流利嗎？  [fluent: 流利的]

13
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:44,000
[013] We rely on customer reviews to help spread the word.
我們依賴顧客評價來協助宣傳。  [customer reviews: 顧客評價]

14
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:52,000
[014] Do you mind if I work from home?
我可以在家工作嗎？  [work from home: 在家工作]

15
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:00,000
[015] Excuse me, I think the vending machine is broken.
不好意思，我想這自動販賣機壞掉了。  [vending machine: 自動販賣機]

16
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:09,000
[016] Great news! I finally got a hold of Mr. Thomas.
好消息！我終於聯絡上了 Thomas 先生了。  [get a hold of: 聯絡上]

17
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:17,000
[017] I guess I will have to come back another time.
看來我得改天再來了。  [come back: 回來、再來]

18
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:25,000
[018] He'll be a great addition to our team.
他會成為我們 team 的絕佳助力。  [team: 團隊]

19
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:33,000
[019] We have quite a wide selection.
我們提供相當多樣化的選擇。  [selection: 選擇，可供選擇的項目]

20
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:39,000
[020] How does tomorrow sound?
明天方便嗎？  [tomorrow: 明天]

21
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:46,000
[021] How much do I owe you?
我欠你多少錢？  [owe: 欠，應付]

22
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:54,000
[022] We have a promotion going on right now.
現在我們有一場促銷活動正在進行。  [promotion: 促銷活動]

23
00:02:54,000 --> 00:03:01,000
[023] I'd be happy to provide you with a quote.
我很樂意為您提供一份報價。  [quote: 報價]

24
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:10,000
[024] I'd like to book a direct flight to Tokyo for April 5th, please.
我想預訂 4 月 5 日飛東京的直飛班機，麻煩了。  [book: 預訂]

25
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:17,000
[025] We don't want to keep our clients waiting.
我們不希望讓客戶久等。  [wait: 等待]

26
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:24,000
[026] I'm flattered.
您過獎了。  [flattered: 受寵若驚的，被誇讚的]

27
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:31,000
[027] We could use his help.
我們可能會需要他的幫助。  [help: 幫助]

28
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:38,000
[028] I'm just going to run a few errands.
我只是要跑幾個小差事。  [errand: 跑腿，差事]

29
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:47,000
[029] I'm looking for the missing film footage of the local rivers.
我正在尋找遺失的當地河流影像資料。  [missing: 遺失的，消失的]

30
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:54,000
[030] I'm staying here at the hotel on business.
我因公務暫住在這間飯店。  [stay: 停留，住宿]

31
00:03:54,000 --> 00:04:03,000
[031] We can't let ourselves fall behind schedule.
我們不能讓進度落後。  [fall behind: 落後，延遲]

32
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:10,000
[032] I'm trying to locate an article.
我正在找一篇文章。  [locate: 找出，找到]

33
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:18,000
[033] I appreciate you meeting with me today.
我很感謝您今天能與我見面。  [appreciate: 感謝]

34
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:26,000
[034] How much money have we collected in fines for overdue books?
我們因逾期還書收了多少罰金？  [collect: 收取]

35
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:35,000
[035] I'd recommend consulting with our web designer.
我建議您諮詢一下我們的網頁設計師。  [recommend: 推薦]

36
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:43,000
[036] I'll have to get the cost approved first.
我得先取得費用的批准。  [approve: 批准]

37
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:53,000
[037] I'm having trouble getting hold of last month's sales figures for our new line of menswear.
我在取得我們上個月新男裝系列的銷售數據方面遇到困難。  [trouble: 麻煩，困難]

38
00:04:53,000 --> 00:05:01,000
[038] I'm not authorized to give refunds.
我沒有權限辦理退款。  [authorize: 授權，批准]

39
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:09,000
[039] I guess I'll check the theater's website to see if the show is still on.
我想我會上劇院網站確認一下，看那場表演是否還有在演。  [check: 確認]

40
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:18,000
[040] I think I'd rather just return it and get my money back.
我想我寧可退貨拿回錢好了。  [return: 退還]

41
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:26,000
[041] It looks like we are going to be on schedule.
看起來我們會依照行程進度順利進行。  [schedule: 行程，進度]

42
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:33,000
[042] That makes sense.
那就說得通了。  [make sense: 有道理，說得通]

43
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:42,000
[043] We have a private dining area that seats up to 30 people.
我們有一個最多可容納 30 人的私人用餐區。  [private dining area: 私人用餐區]

44
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:51,000
[044] You can try out our product and see how well it meets your needs.
您可以試用我們的產品，看是否符合您的需求。  [try out: 試用]

45
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:59,000
[045] I bet it would cost a fortune.
我敢說那會花不少錢。  [cost a fortune: 花大錢]

46
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:07,000
[046] I can get started with the orientation.
我可以開始進行新生訓練。  [orientation: 新生訓練]

47
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:16,000
[047] I can give you the money for the security deposit today.
我今天可以把押金交給您。  [security deposit: 押金，保證金]

48
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:24,000
[048] I can renew your subscription now, if you'd like.
如果您願意，我現在可以幫您續訂。  [renew: 更新，續訂，續約]

49
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:33,000
[049] We can have the cake ready for you first thing in the morning.
我們可以一早第一件事就幫您把蛋糕準備好。  [have... ready: 準備好…]

50
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:41,000
[050] I don't mind working extra hours to meet deadlines.
為了在期限內完工，我不介意加班。  [deadline: 截止期限]

51
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:49,000
[051] I don't think we could afford to do that.
我認為我們沒辦法負擔那樣做的費用。  [afford: 有能力負擔]

52
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:57,000
[052] I got stuck in rush hour traffic.
我在尖峰時段時塞在車陣當中了。  [rush hour traffic: 尖峰時段的交通]

53
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:07,000
[053] I have an appointment with Dr. Park for my annual physical exam.
我和朴醫生約好要做年度的身體檢查。  [annual physical exam: 年度身體檢查]

54
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:17,000
[054] I have to stay in London one more day to wrap up some business.
我必須在倫敦多待一天，把一些業務收尾。  [wrap up: 結束，收尾]

55
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:26,000
[055] I just got a new glasses prescription from my eye doctor.
我剛從眼科醫生那裡拿到了一張配鏡度數單。  [prescription: 處方]

56
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:34,000
[056] I need a document that shows your current address.
我需要一份顯示你目前地址的文件。  [document: 文件]

57
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:43,000
[057] I probably won't be able to make it on time.
我可能無法準時到達。  [on time: 準時]

58
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:53,000
[058] I recently withdrew from a course due to a scheduling conflict.
因為課程衝突，我最近退選了一個科目。  [scheduling conflict: 行程衝突]

59
00:07:53,000 --> 00:08:01,000
[059] I use the automatic bank withdrawal.
我使用銀行自動扣款服務。  [automatic bank withdrawal: 銀行自動扣款]

60
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:10,000
[060] I was wondering if you have any chocolate cakes available.
我想知道是否有巧克力蛋糕可以購買。  [available: 可取得的]

61
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:18,000
[061] I will get a few estimates from some contractors.
我會找幾位承包商拿一些報價單。  [estimates: 報價單 = quotes]

62
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:25,000
[062] I wonder if they cater.
我在想他們是否有提供外燴服務。  [cater: 提供外燴服務]

63
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:34,000
[063] I work almost exclusively on research.
我幾乎只從事研究工作。  [exclusively: 排外地，僅只]

64
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:42,000
[064] We are going to work out an experiment.
我們即將進行一項實驗。  [experiment: 實驗]

65
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:51,000
[065] I'd like to offer you the position of assistant manager.
我想提供您副理這個職位。  [assistant manager: 副理]

66
00:08:51,000 --> 00:09:00,000
[066] I'll be out of the office until later this afternoon.
我今天下午晚點才會進辦公室。  [out of the office: 不在辦公室]

67
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:09,000
[067] I'll mark the order urgent to get it delivered tomorrow.
我會把這筆訂單標記為急件，讓它明天可以送達。  [urgent: 緊急的]

68
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:16,000
[068] I'm calling to ask a favor.
我打電話來是想請你幫個忙。  [favor: 恩惠]

69
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:24,000
[069] I'm going to be selling refreshments.
我打算賣些點心食品。  [refreshments: 茶點]

70
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:32,000
[070] I'm sorry for the short notice.
很抱歉臨時通知您。  [short notice: 臨時通知]

71
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:41,000
[071] I'm trying to put together the newsletter for next month.
我正試著整理下個月的電子報。  [newsletter: 電子快報]

72
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:48,000
[072] I've been spending too much on fuel lately.
我最近加油的花費太多了。  [fuel: 燃料]

73
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:57,000
[073] I've been trying all morning but I can't get online.
我整個早上都在嘗試連上網路，但就是連不上。  [online: 上網，在線上]

74
00:09:57,000 --> 00:10:06,000
[074] I've decided to extend my trip to do some sightseeing.
我決定延長我的旅程，四處觀光一下。  [extend: 延長]

75
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:15,000
[075] I subscribe to your newspaper, but it didn't come yesterday.
我有訂閱貴社的報紙，但到昨天還沒收到。  [subscribe: 訂閱報紙、雜誌等]

76
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:24,000
[076] In fact, I volunteered to help out during the concert.
其實，我在這場音樂會當中有參與志工服務。  [volunteer: 參與志工服務]

77
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:33,000
[077] It is nice for the staff to get together socially.
員工能夠私下聚會一下是件好事。  [socially: 在社交方面]

78
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:42,000
[078] It must have taken a lot of effort to organize the event.
籌辦這個活動一定花了不少心力吧。  [organize: 籌劃]

79
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:51,000
[079] It will only take us 5 minutes to get there on foot.
我們走路過去那裡只要五分鐘。  [on foot: 步行]

80
00:10:51,000 --> 00:11:00,000
[080] It's important that the dining area be wheelchair accessible.
用餐區有無障礙通道是很重要的。  [wheelchair accessible: 可供輪椅進出的]

81
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:09,000
[081] Just get the receipt for the cost so you can be reimbursed.
只要把費用的收據拿來，就可以報銷。  [reimburse: 報銷]

82
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:18,000
[082] Let's see if Robert has any flexibility in his schedule.
我們來看一下 Robert 的行程是否有彈性調整空間。  [flexibility: 彈性，靈活性]

83
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:25,000
[083] Let me explain some of the details.
我來說明一下一些細節。  [details: 細節]

84
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:34,000
[084] Make your résumé stand out from other applicants.
讓你的履歷從其他應徵者中脫穎而出吧。  [stand out: 突出，顯眼]

85
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:42,000
[085] Oh, I wish I had known that before.
唉，要是我之前就知道那件事就好了。  [wish: 但願，適用假設語氣]

86
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:50,000
[086] One of our technicians called in sick leave.
我們有一位技術人員打電話來請了病假。  [sick leave: 病假]

87
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:59,000
[087] Our events are appropriate for children as well as adults.
我們的活動適合兒童與成人參加。  [appropriate: 適當的]

88
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:08,000
[088] Our new products have attracted some interest from overseas.
我們的新產品已經吸引了一些海外顧客關注。  [attract: 吸引關注、興趣等]

89
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:17,000
[089] Our product line does cost a little more than others.
我們的產品系列確實比其他品牌稍微貴一些。  [cost a little more: 稍微貴一點]

90
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:24,000
[090] Thanks for getting back to me so promptly.
謝謝你這麼快就回覆我。  [promptly: 迅速地]

91
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:32,000
[091] That's exactly what I was thinking.
那正是我所想的！  [exactly: 正是]

92
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:41,000
[092] The car runs mostly on electricity instead of gasoline.
這輛車主要是靠電力運行，不是用汽油。  [electricity: 電力]

93
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:49,000
[093] The certificate is valid for a year.
這張證書效期為一年。  [valid: 有效的]

94
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:58,000
[094] The chef is almost out of ingredients for the chicken.
主廚做雞肉料理的材料幾乎要用完了。  [be almost out of: 幾乎要用完…了]

95
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:08,000
[095] The company will cover all your relocation expenses.
公司將負擔您所有的搬遷費用。  [relocation expenses: 搬遷費用]

96
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:16,000
[096] The gallery is within walking distance.
走幾步路就到畫廊了。  [walking distance: 步行可達的距離]

97
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:25,000
[097] The lecture is supposed to start in 15 minutes.
這場講座預計在 15 分鐘後開始。  [be supposed to: 預計要，應該要]

98
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:34,000
[098] The medicine is for my seasonal allergies.
這藥是給我治療季節性過敏用的。  [seasonal allergies: 季節性過敏]

99
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:41,000
[099] The museum is close by.
博物館就在旁邊。  [close by: 就在旁邊]

100
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:51,000
[100] The shipment is behind schedule. / The project is behind schedule.
這批貨運的進度已經延遲了。／這個專案進度落後了。  [behind schedule: 進度落後]

101
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:59,000
[101] The paint on the door is peeling off.
門上的油漆正在剝落。  [peel off: 剝落]

102
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:09,000
[102] The space is available on a first come, first served basis.
該空間採取先到先得的方式使用。  [first come, first served: 先到先得]

103
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:17,000
[103] There are a lot of dishes to choose from.
有很多道菜可供選擇。  [choose from: 從…選擇]

104
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:23,000
[104] There must be a leak.
一定有個地方會漏。  [leak: 漏出]

105
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:31,000
[105] These strawberries are locally grown.
這些草莓是土生土長的。  [locally grow: 當地種植]

106
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:40,000
[106] They're understaffed and they're trying to find more employees.
他們人手不足，且正試圖尋找更多員工。  [understaffed: 人手不足的]

107
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:49,000
[107] This schedule shows our regular hours.
這時間表顯示了我們的正常營業時間。  [regular hours: 正常營業時間]

108
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:58,000
[108] This software package is better suited to my department's needs.
這個軟體套件更適合我們部門的需求。  [suited: 合適的]

109
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:05,000
[109] Trains run pretty often.
火車班次相當頻繁。  [often: 經常]

110
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:13,000
[110] Two of the digits were reversed.
有兩個數字顛倒了。  [reverse: 顛倒]

111
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:22,000
[111] Unfortunately, several refunds weren't processed on time.
很遺憾，有幾筆退款未能準時處理。  [process: 處理]

112
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:32,000
[112] We'll be doing routine maintenance on your apartment next week.
我們將在下週對您的公寓進行定期保養。  [routine maintenance: 定期保養]

113
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:39,000
[113] Thanks for the heads-up.
謝謝（您）事先告知。  [heads-up: 事先告知]

114
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:47,680
[114] Sports memorabilia collection
運動紀念品收藏。  [memorabilia: 紀念品 = souvenirs]
